{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure awaits! Join Tyke on a cozy hiking expedition to the sprawling Pine Hearts nature reserve and scale the mountain your father never managed to climb.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash through rockpools, explore mysterious caves, clean up campsites, investigate old castle ruins, and play on the beach as Tyke revisits the scenes of childhood holidays and recollects past adventures with his dad.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.poster.avif?t=1757408702\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.webm?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.mp4?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pine Hearts nature reserve is an enchanting world of crisscrossing paths and shortcuts, filled with surprising interactions. Make lots of new friends and complete quirky quests for locals in need, including:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Judging a vegetable competition! \ud83e\udd55\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conducting a brass band! \ud83c\udfba\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping a ghost! \ud83d\udc7b\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding a whale-watching boat! \ud83d\udc0b\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing wayward bees! \ud83d\udc1d\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting (camera) traps to catch a monster! \ud83d\udcf8\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging up Viking treasure! \ud83d\udc51\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a charming world packed with memories and make it a holiday to remember for everyone.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.poster.avif?t=1757408702\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.webm?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.mp4?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartfelt story about family loss \u2013 </strong>A warm and thoughtful tale about honouring the memory of Tyke\u2019s late father, told with tenderness and care\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunny Scottish setting \u2013 </strong>Explore an interconnected world inspired by our childhood holidays to the Scottish Highlands\u2019 Cairngorms. Sun added by artistic license\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just a park \u2013 </strong>Sandy beaches, dusty catacombs, lush golf courses, bustling caravan parks, and more await explorers travelling to the Pine Hearts nature reserve\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle puzzling and stress-free exploration \u2013</strong> Unlock equipment and abilities at your own pace to open shortcuts and reach new areas of the Metroidvania-style map\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical characters and quests \u2013 </strong>Make new friends and do good deeds for them\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet cute dogs </strong>\ud83d\udc36 <strong>\u2013 </strong>We are @CanYouPetTheDog verified\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pat cool crabs </strong>\ud83e\udd80 <strong>\u2013 </strong>If @CanYouPatTheCrab existed, we\u2019d be verified too\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet contemplative moments</strong> <strong>\u2013 </strong>Sit down on a bench to take a breather and admire the sights\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive accessibility options \u2013 </strong>Simplified controls, colour-blocking, black-and-white, and high-contrast modes, visual FX toggles, font scaling, full input remapping, and more\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Pine Hearts</strong></i> is the perfect game for players seeking a relaxing and intuitive adventure about exploring nature, bonding with adorable characters, and making family memories that last beyond lifetimes. It\u2019s inspired by our own experiences and dedicated to those whose cherished memories carry forward with us on the journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/cce701d3831d8677a9205af78f0bbb21.avif?t=1757408702\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pine Hearts Run Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/e2b23fa5284f5ac1b9340e9f7a274bbbe7af30e0.jpg"},{"name":"Gruffumpkin Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/fadaf31249266be9b4a5f43fde45582f8e3ffc72.jpg"},{"name":"Granny's Gala","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/f7f89e4167df45a0515de0329b0ea0460b68bc0c.jpg"},{"name":"Par for the Course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/ba322eac87dc9c52d266af1958c586d7b182db93.jpg"},{"name":"Not Ready Yet...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/1401a2fc652a01dedc8cec479f47fdb0995ae075.jpg"},{"name":"Bon Voyage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/418c1432d7afad45b4478ab4571897f8820d054b.jpg"},{"name":"Lost 'n' Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/1535b663d15032cfb4781d56a116a06639ed7856.jpg"},{"name":"A Bonnie Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/9c27a3792b1cfb1192b1d0cafbea7e71ce2a325f.jpg"},{"name":"The Egg Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/eff6ebf374bc932573077fc4a52eedafd0495aa1.jpg"},{"name":"The Standing Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1781010/893ef768dc399b2e6f416b3c27abea13426335e3.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1781010?t=1757408702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757408702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/4c2b9c190a52201266432a3f494871763566f9e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757408702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/4c2b9c190a52201266432a3f494871763566f9e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757408702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features added!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touchscreen Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary Quest Tracker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles Tracker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Sway toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth Of Field toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Damping toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional performance optimisations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New languages!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese localisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korean localisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional Chinese localisation</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure awaits! Join Tyke on a cozy hiking expedition to the sprawling Pine Hearts nature reserve and scale the mountain your father never managed to climb.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash through rockpools, explore mysterious caves, clean up campsites, investigate old castle ruins, and play on the beach as Tyke revisits the scenes of childhood holidays and recollects past adventures with his dad.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.poster.avif?t=1757408702\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.webm?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/7a8952c2c0acc4e6dad46c79754e1bfe.mp4?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pine Hearts nature reserve is an enchanting world of crisscrossing paths and shortcuts, filled with surprising interactions. Make lots of new friends and complete quirky quests for locals in need, including:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Judging a vegetable competition! \ud83e\udd55\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conducting a brass band! \ud83c\udfba\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping a ghost! \ud83d\udc7b\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding a whale-watching boat! \ud83d\udc0b\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing wayward bees! \ud83d\udc1d\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting (camera) traps to catch a monster! \ud83d\udcf8\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging up Viking treasure! \ud83d\udc51\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a charming world packed with memories and make it a holiday to remember for everyone.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.poster.avif?t=1757408702\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.webm?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/36c94d90fd8262ea4457a56cfff26c1c.mp4?t=1757408702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartfelt story about family loss \u2013 </strong>A warm and thoughtful tale about honouring the memory of Tyke\u2019s late father, told with tenderness and care\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunny Scottish setting \u2013 </strong>Explore an interconnected world inspired by our childhood holidays to the Scottish Highlands\u2019 Cairngorms. Sun added by artistic license\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just a park \u2013 </strong>Sandy beaches, dusty catacombs, lush golf courses, bustling caravan parks, and more await explorers travelling to the Pine Hearts nature reserve\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle puzzling and stress-free exploration \u2013</strong> Unlock equipment and abilities at your own pace to open shortcuts and reach new areas of the Metroidvania-style map\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical characters and quests \u2013 </strong>Make new friends and do good deeds for them\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet cute dogs </strong>\ud83d\udc36 <strong>\u2013 </strong>We are @CanYouPetTheDog verified\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pat cool crabs </strong>\ud83e\udd80 <strong>\u2013 </strong>If @CanYouPatTheCrab existed, we\u2019d be verified too\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet contemplative moments</strong> <strong>\u2013 </strong>Sit down on a bench to take a breather and admire the sights\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive accessibility options \u2013 </strong>Simplified controls, colour-blocking, black-and-white, and high-contrast modes, visual FX toggles, font scaling, full input remapping, and more\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Pine Hearts</strong></i> is the perfect game for players seeking a relaxing and intuitive adventure about exploring nature, bonding with adorable characters, and making family memories that last beyond lifetimes. It\u2019s inspired by our own experiences and dedicated to those whose cherished memories carry forward with us on the journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781010/extras/cce701d3831d8677a9205af78f0bbb21.avif?t=1757408702\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p>","developers":["Hyper Luminal Games Ltd"],"dlc":[2996720,2996940],"genres":[{"description":"Advent